'''Spectre''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually from the [[Spectre Gamepass]] for 1,699 Robux or from the [[Ghost Bundle]] for 3,399 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2022|2022 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
This gun has a thick blocky cyan body with darker patches on it. It is surrounded by a grey barrel and frame. The trigger is grey and the handle is a darker cyan.

==Trivia==
*It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Phantom]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Spectre Set|Spectre Set]].
*This and its partner knife are the third gamepass weapons where you had the option to buy it as part of a bundle or separately, the others being [[Plasmablade]], [[Plasmabeam]], [[Iceflake]], and [[Icebeam]].

